# Machine: Lambda GPU box

I am running directly on a bare-metal GPU machine — there is NO scheduler
(no SLURM). Run training/inference directly; use tmux for long jobs.

- GPUs: <FILL IN: e.g. 8x H100 80GB>  (check: nvidia-smi)
- Note: if this is the B200 node (150.136.211.158), it is power-capped at 1000W —
  spare VRAM does not buy throughput, and nvidia-smi's 1s utilization is misleading
- Conda / venv: <FILL IN: path + default env>
- Data lives in: <FILL IN>
- Checkpoints go to: <FILL IN>
- Long runs: always inside tmux; name sessions after the run
